      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create embed_text.py in the current working directory.\nTask: generates an embedding vector for one text string.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc29930c001dmosS425LAw4P0",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2993060016fVRownaUj0Dof",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d66d19ffeR7cG5J62POyiZ0",
      "time_created": 1789863236460,
      "time_updated": 1789863236461
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "type": "step-start"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2998ce001qy5ClZ5i12XppX",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc299374001mhC2VC6pEqORoA",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d66d19ffeR7cG5J62POyiZ0",
      "time_created": 1789863237839,
      "time_updated": 1789863237840
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Embedding Provider**\n\nOkay, I've decided to go with Google Cloud's Vertex AI for the text embedding. It seems like the best fit here. I'm focusing on Vertex AI now as the external embedding provider.\n\n\n**Defining the Script's Purpose**\n\nI'm now focused on the practical implementation of generating embeddings. My plan is to create a Python script, `embed_text.py`, specifically for this task. The script's primary goal will be to generate an embedding vector from a given text string. I'll utilize Google Cloud Vertex AI, and make sure to integrate the proper client libraries.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863239112,
          "start": 1789863237840
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2998d0001yD3SoPlaRqWQDd",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc299374001mhC2VC6pEqORoA",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d66d19ffeR7cG5J62POyiZ0",
      "time_created": 1789863237840,
      "time_updated": 1789863239113
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "AV3EFWgOixuAC4sm",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import vertexai\nfrom vertexai.preview.language_models import TextEmbeddingModel\n\ndef embed_text(text: str) -> list[float]:\n    \"\"\"Generates an embedding vector for a given text string using Vertex AI.\n\n    Args:\n        text: The text string to embed.\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of floats representing the embedding vector.\n    \"\"\"\n    vertexai.init(project=\"YOUR_PROJECT_ID\", location=\"YOUR_REGION\") # Replace with your project ID and region\n    model = TextEmbeddingModel.from_pretrained(\"textembedding-gecko@001\")\n    embeddings = model.get_embeddings([text])\n    return embeddings[0].values\n\n",
            "filePath": "embed_text.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "diagnostics": {},
            "exists": false,
            "filepath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-lwlqpy5r/embed_text.py",
            "truncated": false
          },
